# The shared environment of every model on the leaderboard, at the versions of the STRABLE paper
# (salts_env, 2026-03-23, Python 3.12.12). Edit this list, then regenerate env/requirements.txt with the
# paper's full freeze as constraints, so every dependency also keeps the paper's version:
#   uv pip compile env/requirements.in -c <paper freeze> --python-version 3.12 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --no-header --no-annotate -o env/requirements.txt
# A change here is an environment change: it needs the maintainer, and every model is re-checked.

